claim.claim-text:
polarizing a light emitted from a light source by a polarizer, wherein the polarizer adjusts a polarization orientation of the light relative to a first beam splitter;
splitting the light, by the first beam splitter, along a first light path and a second light path;
modulating the light along the second light path, by a spatial light modulator, to generate a highlight light; and
combining, by a second beam splitter, a portion of the highlight light from the second light path and the light from the first light path to form a projection image including at least one highlight feature.
